TITLE Albite kinetics + fixed-pressure H2S(g), check Ba at steps 10 and 70
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH   2 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(3) 4
    Fe(2) 4
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 10 in 100
        -cvode true
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file albite_h2s_sel.txt
    -reset false
    -step true
    -time true
    -totals Ba
END
